北出为门水，水东北历阳华之山，即华阳也。华，音户化翻。芈，眉婢翻。相，息亮翻。卒，子恤翻。冢，知陇翻。班志，高陵县属冯翊，泾阳县属安定。杜佑曰：京兆泾阳县乃秦封泾阳君之地。汉泾阳县在今平凉郡界泾阳故城是也。宋白曰：雍州泾阳本秦旧县。与杜佑同。索隐曰：高陵君，名显；泾阳君，名悝。索，山客翻。悝，苦回翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c808d96-db0e-11ef-94b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"惠王","people_name_jianti_auto":"惠王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c808dd3-db0e-11ef-8825-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"惠文王","people_name_jianti_auto":"惠文王","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c808dd4-db0e-11ef-93bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭王","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭王","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c808dd5-db0e-11ef-8818-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭襄王","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭襄王","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c808dd6-db0e-11ef-ad61-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"惠王，卽惠文王。昭王，卽昭襄王。","note_content_jianti_auto":"惠王，即惠文王。昭王，即昭襄王。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8c808dd2-db0e-11ef-8d00-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"惠文后","people_name_jianti_auto":"惠文后","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c808dd9-db0e-11ef-b54f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭王","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭王","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c808dda-db0e-11ef-a185-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"惠文后，昭王嫡母也。死於正命曰良死。","note_content_jianti_auto":"惠文后，昭王嫡母也。死于正命曰良死。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"8c808dd8-db0e-11ef-bc4e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_z